    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Moussaka has three components -- roasted aubergine, spiced meat sauce, and bechamel. Each can be made separately ahead of time. The bechamel is the most important to get right: add warm milk slowly and whisk constantly." }]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
